### EXTRA STARTUP INFORMATION ###
# 1. Must include the Google service account google-key-file.json file in the project's root directory (DM MrWalrus)
# 2. DM MrWalrus for access to tokens/keys/etc
# 3. Set up databases
#   - npx prisma migrate dev --name anyName
#   - npx prisma generate
#   - npm ls prisma @prisma/client
# For WalrusMC site integration (required by Google services and server access) you must run the WalrusMC WebServer

